---

---

<section id="setup" class="section">
  <div class="setup-header reveal">
    <h2 class="heading-lg">bring your own keys. keep your data.</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="setup-grid">
    <div class="card setup-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
      <div class="setup-card-header">
        <span class="setup-step">1</span>
        <h3 class="heading-md">openai</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="setup-desc">powers both transcription (gpt-4o-transcribe) and structuring (gpt-4o-mini).</p>
      <ol class="setup-steps">
        <li>create an account at <a href="https://platform.openai.com/signup" target="_blank" rel="noopener">platform.openai.com</a></li>
        <li>go to <a href="https://platform.openai.com/api-keys" target="_blank" rel="noopener">api keys</a> and create a new secret key</li>
        <li>add a payment method under <a href="https://platform.openai.com/settings/organization/billing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">billing</a> (pay-as-you-go)</li>
        <li>paste the key into fiddlehead preferences</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="setup-note">cost: ~$0.006/min transcription + ~$0.001 per meeting structuring.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card setup-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
      <div class="setup-card-header">
        <span class="setup-step">2</span>
        <h3 class="heading-md">assemblyai <span class="setup-optional">optional</span></h3>
      </div>
      <p class="setup-desc">alternative transcription provider. switch between openai and assemblyai in settings.</p>
      <ol class="setup-steps">
        <li>create an account at <a href="https://www.assemblyai.com/app/signup" target="_blank" rel="noopener">assemblyai.com</a></li>
        <li>copy your api key from the <a href="https://www.assemblyai.com/app/account" target="_blank" rel="noopener">account dashboard</a></li>
        <li>paste it into fiddlehead preferences</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="setup-note">cost: ~$0.003/min. half the price of openai transcription.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="setup-privacy reveal reveal-delay-3">
    <span class="glyph glyph-saved">✓</span>
    <p>
      your api keys are stored locally in macos keychain.
      audio goes directly to openai or assemblyai.
      <strong>there are no fiddlehead servers.</strong>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .setup-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .setup-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .setup-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .setup-card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .setup-step {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .setup-desc {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .setup-steps {
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: step;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .setup-steps li {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    padding-left: 20px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .setup-steps li::before {
    content: '▸';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--accent);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .setup-note {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    opacity: 0.6;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .setup-privacy {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: var(--space-xl);
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .setup-privacy p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .setup-privacy strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .setup-optional {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    opacity: 0.5;
    margin-left: 4px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .setup-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
